  "prefLabel": "En 1012.11 Facility Operating Characteristics",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "En 1012.11 Facility Operating Characteristics. The group study shall take into account the proposed facilities’ design and operating characteristics and study the facilities according to how the facilities are proposed to be operated. If the facilities limit export pursuant to En 1013, the group study shall use export capacity instead of nameplate rating, except when assessing fault current contribution.\n\nSource. #14657, eff 9-1-26, EXPIRES: 9-1-36",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/en1000.html"
